  "title": "Quick Crunchy Norwegian Mars Bar Bars",
  "description": "A crowd-pleasing Norwegian dish featuring Mars bars, with a garlicky and crisp twist, perfect for a keto-friendly dessert.",
  "cuisine": "Norwegian",
